OL,3,GNEWSAWitness denies 'lying to protect
OL,4,Aherself' after head teacher dragged to
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe passenger in a car driven by her
OL,8,Fcousin which dragged a head teacher
OL,9,Fmore than a mile to his death denied
OL,10,F"not telling the truth" to "protect"
OL,11,Fherself.
OL,13,FGabrielle Debotte, 27, had told a jury
OL,14,Fthat driver Simon Richardson knew
OL,15,F56-year-old cyclist Michael Mullins was
OL,16,Funder the wheels of his car after
OL,17,Fcolliding with him at a junction on 20
OL,18,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
