OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWitness denies 'lying to protect
OL,4,Aherself' after head teacher dragged to
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,8,Fhas heard Richardson drove on for 1.36
OL,9,Fmiles (2.2km) until father-of-two Mr
OL,10,FMullins was finally thrown free on a
OL,11,Fcountry lane in Lymm, Cheshire, where
OL,12,Fhe died a short time later.
OL,14,FRichardson, 35, denies he knew Mr
OL,15,FMullins was under the wheels and has
OL,16,Fpleaded not guilty to murder and an
OL,17,Falternative count of manslaughter.
